That means the chart now requires you to explicitly tell how the collector should run.

🎯 What is mode?
OpenTelemetry Collector can run in different Kubernetes modes:

Mode	Meaning
deployment	Normal Deployment (1 or more replicas)
daemonset	One collector per node
statefulset	Rare, advanced use
The chart no longer defaults this — you must choose.

✅ Quick Fix (Working Command for Minikube)
Use BOTH required fields:

