Short answer:

❌ No, in real production you should NEVER blindly deploy a Helm chart without reviewing it.

But…

✅ You also don’t manually read 20,000 lines of YAML every time.

There is a professional way to handle this.

Let’s break it down properly.

🧠 First: Why You Should NOT Blindly Deploy
Helm charts like:

kube-prometheus-stack

loki

tempo

Generate thousands of lines of YAML including:

ClusterRoles

ClusterRoleBindings

CRDs

Webhooks

RBAC

PodSecurity settings

