kubectl get hpa -n observability
Check logs:

kubectl logs -n observability deploy/otel
🎯 STEP 7 — Application Configuration
Your applications should send telemetry to:

otel-collector.observability:4317
Or fully qualified:

otel-collector.observability.svc.cluster.local:4317
🎯 STEP 8 — Expose Metrics To Prometheus
Since Prometheus runs in monitoring, create a ServiceMonitor in that namespace.

apiVersion: monitoring.coreos.com/v1
