This is PUSH model.

In OTEL:

exporters:
  loki:
    endpoint: http://loki.observability.svc.cluster.local:3100/loki/api/v1/push
Pipeline:

logs:
  receivers: [otlp]
  processors: [memory_limiter, batch]
  exporters: [loki]
Workflow:

Application → OTLP → OTEL → HTTP Push → Loki
Automatic. No scraping.

